{"abstract":[{"text":"Share an mdoc with a reader nearby over Bluetooth, or be the reader,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with ISO\/IEC 18013-5 device retrieval.","type":"text"}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"Presenting-in-person","title":"Presenting in person","identifiers":["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityPresentation","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityReaderIdentity","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityTimeouts","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityError"],"generated":true}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"In person, the holder shows a QR code and the reader scans it: the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"code carries the holder’s ephemeral key and how to reach it over","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Bluetooth LE. The two devices then exchange encrypted messages over","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"GATT. The package carries the Bluetooth side itself: your app shows or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"scans the QR code, follows the session’s states, and asks the holder.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Engagement is by QR code only. NFC engagement (a tap instead of the"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"code) is in OID4VCgo’s Kotlin library, not this package: an iOS holder","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"can’t answer a reader’s tap, and an iOS reader can’t tap a holder. An","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Android reader or holder that offers both still works with this","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"package over the QR code.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Both sides need ","type":"text"},{"code":"NSBluetoothAlwaysUsageDescription","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" in the app’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Info.plist. Keep the app in the foreground during a session: neither","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"side keeps one going while the app is suspended. A session answers one","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"request. Bluetooth failures are ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityError","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":"s; protocol failures","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"are ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":"s.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Share as the holder","anchor":"Share-as-the-holder","level":3,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/startProximityPresentation(timeouts:modes:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" returns a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityPresentation","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" whose "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityPresentation\/qrCode","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" you"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"show. It offers both ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityBLEMode","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"s by default: it advertises"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for the reader and scans for it at once, until a reader connects"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"either way (a reader offered both should connect in central client"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"mode). Pass "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"modes"},{"type":"text","text":" to offer one. It then reports"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityPresentation\/State-swift.enum\/requestReceived(_:)","isActive":true},{"text":" with who is asking","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and what: ask the holder, then respond or decline.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import Foundation","import OID4VCWallet","","\/\/\/ What the holder agreed to share: a requested document, the held","\/\/\/ mdoc to answer it with, and the elements to disclose.","struct InPersonAnswer {","    let document: Int","    let credentialID: String","    let elements: [MdocPresentation.Element]","}","","\/\/\/ Shares an mdoc in person. `showQRCode` displays the code; `consent`","\/\/\/ shows the reader's request and returns the holder's answer, or nil","\/\/\/ to decline. Returns whether the copy shared had been seen by another","\/\/\/ Verifier, or nil when nothing was shared.","func shareInPerson(wallet: Wallet, showQRCode: (String) -> Void,","                   consent: (ProximityPresentation.Request) async -> InPersonAnswer?) async throws -> Bool? {","    let session = try wallet.startProximityPresentation()","    showQRCode(session.qrCode)","    for await state in session.states {","        switch state {","        case .requestReceived(let request):","            guard let answer = await consent(request) else {","                await session.decline()","                return nil","            }","            \/\/ The holder key signs now: Face ID, if the key store asks.","            return try await session.respond(document: answer.document, credentialID: answer.credentialID,","                                             elements: answer.elements)","        case .failed(let error):","            throw error","        case let state where state.isFinal:","            return nil","        default:","            continue","        }","    }","    return nil","}"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Show "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityPresentation\/Request\/reader","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" on the consent screen. A"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reader that signs its request (reader authentication) is named, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityReaderIdentity\/Status-swift.enum\/trusted","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" when its certificate chains","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"to "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/mdocReaderRoots","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":". An unsigned request could"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"come from anyone who scanned the code. As over the Digital Credentials"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"API, "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/requireTrustedMdocReader","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" ends a session"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from any other reader before the holder sees it."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityPresentation\/cancel()","isActive":true},{"text":" ends a session at any point, as the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"holder leaves the screen, say. ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityTimeouts","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" sets how long it","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"waits: by default 60 seconds for a reader to connect, 30 for its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"request, and 300 for the holder to decide."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"anchor":"Read-as-the-verifier","text":"Read as the verifier","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityReader","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" needs no ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet","isActive":true},{"text":": give it the IACAs whose","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"mdocs it accepts, and, to sign its requests so holders see who is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"asking, a key in a ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeyStore","isActive":true},{"text":" and its certificate chain, with the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reader authentication extended key usage","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityReaderConfiguration","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"). The reader is a production one: it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"refuses (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"invalidInput"},{"text":") a configuration that leaves a decision open:","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"which IACAs issue which document types (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"anyIssuerForAnyType"},{"text":", or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"issuerRootsByDocType"},{"text":"), and each role’s revocation (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"revocation"},{"text":" with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"crls"},{"text":", or ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"noRevocationCheck"},{"text":" to decline). ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"development"},{"text":" relaxes","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"this, for trying out a development issuer’s documents; never ship an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"app with it set. ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityReader\/start(qrCode:docType:elements:timeouts:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"takes the holder’s QR code and what to ask for.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["\/\/\/ Reads an mDL's name and portrait from the holder whose QR code was","\/\/\/ scanned. Returns the verified mdoc, or nil if the holder declined or","\/\/\/ the mdoc isn't known to be unrevoked.","func readInPerson(qrCode: String, issuerRoots: String, crls: String) async throws -> VerifiedMdoc? {","    let reader = try ProximityReader(configuration: ProximityReaderConfiguration(","        issuerRoots: issuerRoots, crls: crls, revocation: [.issuer, .status],","        anyIssuerForAnyType: true))","    let session = try reader.start(qrCode: qrCode, docType: \"org.iso.18013.5.1.mDL\",","                                   elements: [\"org.iso.18013.5.1\": [\"given_name\", \"family_name\", \"portrait\"]])","    for await state in session.states {","        switch state {","        case .verified(let mdoc):","            let status = try await session.checkStatus()","            return status == .valid || status == .noStatus ? mdoc : nil","        case .failed(let error):","            throw error","        case let state where state.isFinal:","            return nil","        default:","   